(text "E4-07 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3; §8 (HMC7992LP3DE; G6K-2F-RF-S); §8.1 RF-0/RF-1, HF-13" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 308.61 67.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 08516a09-5e10-5932-b571-be9661a5825e))
(text "RF PCB, relay insertion loss, isolation, return loss and startup PARK are unmeasured.\nВорота (стенд): VNA: HF selector 10 kHz–260 MHz IL ≤0.3 dB, RL ≥21 dB, isolation ≥35 dB at 162–260 MHz plus\nSTACK LF/HF gates. HMC ≥40 dB isolation at 0.1–1.7 GHz (37–40 dB conditional and recorded); verify all DC\nblocks and startup. Check all SMT footprint pad numbers, dimensions, orientation and ground/exposed-pad\nimplementation against the now-verified manufacturer maps. Per RF port P1–P8 and the ch5 IF (W2 GR-2 board\nports): VNA IL/RL of the assembled panel → pigtail → board-connector path in its band against the model loss\ntable (design/E4-review.md), and DC drop/heating at the bias current on P2/P3/P8 (TPS2553 limits\n0.339/0.339/0.192 A) and on ch5 (LNB 13.2 V): no U.FL, MHF or SMA current rating is published." (at 308.61 69.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid eeffdbfe-c6c1-5e5f-acbd-d72e93306c92))
